      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHINING REIGN (7) was a course and distance placegetter (29.82) last time also from the same draw, finishing a one length second in a Grade 5. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Should be in this for a long way. ROMAN FLY (1) turned in a fair 5th placed finish last time at Maitland over 450m (25.51). The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. KALANI CRUISE (6) hit the frame in a Grade 5 two back then found trouble in the run last time and fell at this track. Has the ability and can measure up. NO PEAS PLEASE (4) will give backers a sight.",
